From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sobs <antohasobne@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 23:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] client: messages and their font in the language of the menus

The messages of titles.txt (chapter titles, the hints of the Hazard
Course, "Saved...") stayed English with ui_language russian: Steam's
valve_russian/ has no titles.txt. And they could not be anything else:
the client draws them byte by byte with the credits font, and that of the
25th anniversary gfx.wad has only Latin letters; the charset's font
(creditsfont_cp1251.fnt) replaced only the font of the original gfx.wad.

In another language than English the engine now loads
titles_<game>_<language>.txt instead of titles.txt when there is one
(named after the game, so that a mod keeps its own messages), and uses
the charset's credits font whatever gfx.wad is.
---
 engine/client/cl_scrn.c         |  9 +++++++--
 engine/client/dll_int/cl_game.c | 17 ++++++++++++++++-
 2 files changed, 23 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/engine/client/cl_scrn.c b/engine/client/cl_scrn.c
--- a/engine/client/cl_scrn.c
+++ b/engine/client/cl_scrn.c
@@ -718,8 +718,13 @@
 	float scale = hud_fontscale.value;
 	dword crc = 0;
 
-	// replace default gfx.wad textures by current charset's font
-	if( !CRC32_File( &crc, "gfx.wad" ) || crc == 0x49eb9f16 )
+	const char *language = Cvar_VariableString( "ui_language" );
+
+	// replace default gfx.wad textures by current charset's font; in another
+	// language than English too: the font of the game may not have its
+	// letters (that of the 25th anniversary gfx.wad is Latin only)
+	if( !CRC32_File( &crc, "gfx.wad" ) || crc == 0x49eb9f16
+		|| ( !COM_StringEmpty( language ) && Q_stricmp( language, "english" )))
 	{
 		string charsetFnt;
 
diff --git a/engine/client/dll_int/cl_game.c b/engine/client/dll_int/cl_game.c
--- a/engine/client/dll_int/cl_game.c
+++ b/engine/client/dll_int/cl_game.c
@@ -586,7 +586,22 @@
 	clgame.numTitles = 0;
 
 	fs_offset_t fileSize = 0;
-	char *pMemFile = (char *)FS_LoadFile( filename, &fileSize, false );
+	char *pMemFile = NULL;
+	const char *language = Cvar_VariableString( "ui_language" );
+
+	// in another language than English: titles_<game>_<language>.txt, the
+	// game's messages translated, when there is one (named after the game,
+	// so that it is not taken for the messages of a mod)
+	if( !COM_StringEmpty( language ) && Q_stricmp( language, "english" ))
+	{
+		string name;
+
+		Q_snprintf( name, sizeof( name ), "titles_%s_%s.txt", GI->gamefolder, language );
+		pMemFile = (char *)FS_LoadFile( name, &fileSize, false );
+	}
+
+	if( !pMemFile )
+		pMemFile = (char *)FS_LoadFile( filename, &fileSize, false );
 	if( !pMemFile )
 		return;
 
